cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "TriLens-AMR: genomic antimicrobial resistance prediction in E. coli under lineage and cohort shift"
abstract: >-
  Code, committed results and manuscript for a study of antibiotic resistance prediction from 6,962
  Escherichia coli genomes and 7 antibiotics, including a three-view stacked model, three
  evaluation splits, and pre-registered experiments on determinant calls, an external cohort and a
  second species.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/FaiazPronoy/TriLens-AMR"
keywords:
  - antimicrobial resistance
  - machine learning
  - bacterial genomics
  - Escherichia coli
